{"code":"053290","name":"NE능률","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"교육서비스","sector_desc":"학원·온라인 교육·교재. 학령 인구와 교육 정책 변화에 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1994년 영어교육 및 출판사업 등을 영위할 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2002년 코스닥 시장에 상장됨. 2009년 (주)에치와이의 계열회사로 편입되었으며, 종속기업인 Neungyule Eduphone, Inc.가 청산절차 진행으로 연결대상에서 제외됨. 유아 및 초중고생 대상 교육 출판·서비스 사업을 영위하며, '튜터', '능률VOCA', 'Grammar Zone' 등 베스트셀러 영어 교재 브랜드를 다수 보유하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":1287.0,"open":1329.0,"high":1396.0,"low":1262.0,"volume":6112,"amount":7866144.0,"ret_1d":-3.4509,"gap":-0.3001,"range_pct":10.4118,"ret_5":-5.298,"ret_20":-22.6562,"ret_60":-30.8808,"ret_120":-41.7647,"ret_250":-38.7143,"ma20":1488.0,"ma60":1643.6167,"ma120":1639.6333,"ma200":1784.87,"close_vs_ma200":-27.8939,"close_vs_ma60":-21.6971,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-66.9934,"r2_60":0.698,"slope_120":-25.9456,"r2_120":0.0871,"slope_250":-24.9772,"r2_250":0.317,"high52":2540.0,"low52":1065.0,"pos_52w":15.0508,"dd_52w":-49.3307,"mdd_1y":-51.7382,"atr14_pct":9.7791,"vol_ann_60":49.0397,"vol_avg20":12820.55,"vol_ratio20":0.4767,"vr5":0.2702,"vr20":0.2259,"amount_avg5":10842653.4,"amount_avg20":18649801.45,"amount_avg60":39326016.9833,"obv_chg20":-28.6154,"turnover_20":1.5515,"pv_eff_20":-14.6025,"rsi14":32.3953,"frgn_net_5":2504.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0152,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0152,"frgn_net_20":2973.0,"inst_net_20":-512.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.018,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0031,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0149,"frgn_net_60":-81458.0,"inst_net_60":-2198.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.4929,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0133,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.5062,"frgn_net_120":-319366.0,"inst_net_120":20.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-1.9325,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0001,"smart_net_120_pct":-1.9323,"foreign_ratio":1.74,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.4,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":16.0,"op_margin_q":44.4444,"op_qoq":113.2231,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":145.7143,"rev_yoy":-61.2903,"op_trend_4q":-24.2623,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-11.13,"debt_ratio":28.07,"per":n